# 🧠 Technical Concepts Demonstrated

## 🌐 Networking

* TCP/IP fundamentals.
* IPv4 socket communication.
* Client-server architecture.
* Socket lifecycle management.
* Port binding.
* Connection handling.

## 📡 HTTP

* HTTP/1.1 request structure.
* `GET` requests.
* Status lines.
* HTTP headers.
* MIME types.
* CRLF line termination.
* HTTP response construction.

## ⚙️ Operating Systems

* Socket resource management.
* TCP port states.
* `TIME_WAIT`.
* File descriptors.
* Process interruption.
* Graceful resource cleanup.

## 🐍 Python

* Standard-library networking.
* Binary file I/O.
* Exception handling.
* Filesystem abstraction with `pathlib`.
* Low-level server architecture.

